() Tj
T*
([P5] The channel checks are not a substitute for the company's accounts, and the) Tj
T*
(note says so. The three agents who provided the berth bookings did not give a) Tj
T*
(common definition of a cancelled cargo, and the note does not reconcile their) Tj
T*
(figures. It also treats the port strike as if it had removed most working berths) Tj
T*
(for the whole quarter, which is an assumption rather than an observation. The) Tj
T*
(official index, which is published with a lag, tells a less dramatic story.) Tj
T*
(Readers should treat the estimate as an outlier until the company reports.) Tj
