([P6] The note's method is simple: count the berths that agents say were booked) Tj
T*
(and compare that with the same weeks a year earlier. It does not adjust for the) Tj
T*
(mix of wheat and maize, or for the size of the vessels. Those choices push the) Tj
T*
(estimate lower than a tonnage-based measure would. The note's author says the) Tj
T*
(figure is meant to capture the direction of travel, not the exact loss. The note) Tj
